      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/p/977dab/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2018-08-24T15:14:33.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I'm trying to make sure I'm playing destroyed mission rewards correctly.&nbsp; According to the rulebook, destroyed rewards go into that hero's trash, so I presume they can be shuffled into that hero's deck and redrawn (or retrieved from the trash with the appropriate effects)?&nbsp; They don't have cardbacks, so I assume you put them in the deck reward side up and you just get to know they're coming.</p><p>And specifically, this seems absurdly good with being able to use and re-use the Blood Stone.&nbsp; Am I misunderstanding this rule?</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:51:45.047Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
