      "created_at": "2018-08-24T15:17:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>You have it correct. &nbsp; As long as your hero is still standing the rewards go to that hero’s trash if destroyed. &nbsp;I guess on shuffle I would put it with the objective side up but that’s just personal preference. &nbsp;Regardless when played again they go out reward side up and if they have health they come into play at full health. &nbsp;</p>",
