      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bluedarky/{size}/1975_2.png",
      "created_at": "2018-08-25T10:14:04.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Ameena\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/48/1907_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Ameena:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Yup, as soon as you earn a Reward it completely counts as being one of your cards and the Mission side basically stops existing (unless something makes the card go back into the Mission deck, which I think can happen if the hero gets completely erased).</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Nope, any rewards in a erased heroes deck, hand, trash or play area are removed from the game unless they're still under old character cards.</p>",
